  <item>
    <title>03:伊朗🇮🇷危险与美好可能同时存在吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6658ace094977a26ef1692c4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6658ace094977a26ef1692c4</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 30 May 2024 16:44:16 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>“不要对没有亲身感受过的事情妄下定论</span></p><span></span><p><span>不要随意否定没有眼见为实的人事</span></p><span></span><p><span>没有饱读诗书不可怕人云亦云才可怕</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果不想读万卷书那就行万里路”</span></p><span></span><p><span>最近的新闻让我想起了疫情前的伊朗行🇮🇷</span></p><span></span><p><span>有过惊心动魄也有过热情美好</span></p><span></span><p><span>对这里，始终存在很多误解和偏见，那就亲自去看去感受......</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="260">04:20</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;德黑兰：到达伊朗需要佩戴头巾</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="530">08:50</a> &nbsp;卡尚：遇到惊心动魄的危险事件⚠️</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1102">18:22</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;伊斯法罕：人民的美好生活</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1440">24:00</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;亚兹德：拜火教真实存在</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1502">25:02</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;波斯波利斯：历史的遗迹的心灵震撼</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1665">27:45</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;设拉子：被邀请到本地人家里做客，原来伊朗人民这么热情？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2283">38:03</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;霍尔木兹岛：到达地理课本上的波斯湾</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2347">39:07</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;马什哈德：藏红花的发源地</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2492">41:32</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;大不里士：陆路过境去亚美尼亚</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi-4BI-AISKeK5_aNXbdbB7dRgsU.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>Kashan-Tabatabaei house （豪华的波斯大宅）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhZZeJZZa1IwLwmDnpxhlmVgKu3W.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs7ghgFjaXJG4wDnpx0w2GL8sWRv.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>Isfahan-伊玛目广场夜景 &amp; 悠闲热情的人民</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjjH93KP3LuiF4vWyGVyxCku5t3O.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>Persepolis（波斯波利斯）- 波斯帝国辉煌的落幕</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsOgxQBXNamZPyShC2rgNv9pwPNU.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>Shiraz - 邀请我们到家里做客的一家人</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn2gVVzVjunIm8aUKyMzANIrAsn9.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtY41eOt8Q69cSp6Ggpekmm8btZa.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>Shiraz - 粉色清真寺 &amp; 粉色盐湖</span></p>]]></description>
