    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>完成比完美重要！</span></p><span></span><p><span>在路上就好～</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrNQn1ViI-9YtNVOr8BuwGPw_As0.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>· 仅一人通行的悬崖峭壁</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjynLsT8zVfUKDtn_QABlAwWoKd5.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>·下雪的牛背山 &nbsp;一万个想放弃</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk4LwKXQ0MNoZ6pp5rTJ0-2T_ztS.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>·幸好有这么美的清晨</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lgGC2Z9DLq1ghi_yM9CTujC8TG18.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>·色达｜ 一个缺氧但不缺信仰的地方</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhxP4AiFSabkP2IWxQN82bOF2g6y.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>·天葬开始前在山顶排队等待的秃鹫</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk41CDUfLNUzCwoV3uuGxc8QS_1y.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>·突然下雨后出现的彩虹🌈</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuooTEVegNQ1QEA26e-XP56hZOis.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>·绝美的夜景像繁星点点 &nbsp;因为它遇见了流星🌠</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Flp50ySHsUFaz7qEs65_btpqi6OL.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>·雪后的亚青寺和诵经的弟子</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FloLQ9VftFBLEzVoR2TMuhepCqaQ.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>·满是信徒的亚青寺广场</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ltSoKexUaO3b61tvye3qKd5H_8tC.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>·印象最深的画面 &nbsp;每看一次都觉得质朴而美好</span></p><span></span><p><span>❤️20岁你好 &nbsp;谢谢你的勇敢 &nbsp;留下了这些精彩瞬间～</span></p>]]></description>
